      "side": 1,
      "message": "An example raw mytest.rlib.d output from rustc is like this, N+4 line for N source files:\n\nout/.../mytest.rlib: file1.rs file2.rs\n\nout/.../mytest.rlib.d: file1.rs file2.rs\n\nfile1.rs:\nfile2.rs:\n\nI don\u0027t see a pattern to grep or grep -v.\n\nWhen I applied dep_fixer to it, it became:\nfile2.rs: file1.rs file2.rs file1.rs file2.rs\n\nThat\u0027s no longer a dependency line for mytest.rlib,\nor should i use some special dep_fixer flag?\n\nExcept the first line in the .d file, all others don\u0027t seem to have any use in Android build.",
