      "writtenOn": "2020-08-14T17:31:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. Rustc --emit dep-info output includes multiple targets as they would be accepted by make, but ninja expects only the dependency rule for the $out target. Combining all dependent files from rustc output isn\u0027t right for $out. So I have changed in PS2 to grep only the $out target rule.",
